#X msg 130 420 @full;
#X text 270 420 Alias to @mode full.;
#X msg 130 450 @mode;
#X text 270 450 Output mode. 'full' - output the convolution at each
point of overlap \, with an output length of (M+N-1). At the end-points
of the convolution \, the signals do not overlap completely \, and
boundary effects may be seen. 'valid' - output of length (max(M \,
N)-min(M \, N)+1). The convolution product is only given for points
where the signals overlap completely. Values outside the signal boundary
have no effect. 'same' - output of length max(M \, N). Boundary effects
are still visible. Тип: symbol. Значение по умолчанию: full. Разрешённые
значения: valid \, same \, full.;
